cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus or generator, please cite it as below."
title: "synthetic-receipts-canada: synthetic Canadian receipts with ground truth"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Ragnarush
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ragnarush/synthetic-receipts-canada"
abstract: >-
  Synthetic Canadian receipts, Québec first, generated from templates that reproduce
  the structure of real receipts and filled with verifiably fake data, each with a JSON
  ground truth, for testing OCR engines and receipt-field extractors.
keywords:
  - receipts
  - OCR
  - synthetic data
  - Québec
  - Canada
  - GST
  - QST
